        "original_id": "1216d2ad-2359-54fa-b6cb-e090e10586bc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Volvo Cars\n- Products: Volvo V50, Volvo S40\n- Places: Bologna Motor Show, Ghent, Belgium\n- Concepts: station wagon, compact luxury car, small family car, two generations\n\nFacts:\n- Volvo Cars marketed and produced the Volvo S40, a compact luxury car, from 1995 to 2012 across two generations.\n- Volvo Cars introduced the Volvo V50 at the 2003 Bologna Motor Show as the station wagon version of the Volvo S40 small family car.\n- Volvo Cars manufactured both the Volvo V50 and the Volvo S40 at its facility in Ghent, Belgium.",
